# run/

# ==========================================================================
# Bulk run/deck output (2026-09-21 sweep). None of this belongs in the fork;
# what is worth keeping is archived on pluskal.nas instead. See the umbrella
# repo's docs/NAS_ARCHIVE_MAP.md.
# ==========================================================================

# Steering/CFG/adaLN class-predictor eval output backing the deck slides.
# 624 M / 339 files -> NAS projects/dplm/class_predictor_2026-06-11/ (byte-verified).
# The folder's own README.md stays tracked so the archive is discoverable.
run/class_predictor/*
!run/class_predictor/README.md

# adaLN architecture-slide build dir: ~700 KB of real build code, ~857 M of
# deck churn (6 near-duplicate .pptx + their unpacked trees). Track the builders,
# ignore the artifacts -- they rebuild from the .js scripts via `npm install`.
_adaln_arch_slide/*
!_adaln_arch_slide/*.js
!_adaln_arch_slide/package.json
!_adaln_arch_slide/package-lock.json

# Smaller analysis/eval output dirs from the same period.
_adaln_early_readout/
_adaln_40k_reseed/
analysis/dft_disco_comparison/
analysis/dplm650_vs_disco_priors/
plot/length_audit/
plot/*.png
plot/embedding_space/*.png

# MARTS-DB release snapshots (33 M each). Regenerable via the `marts-db` skill,
# but NOTE 2026-07-31/ is the cited SMILES provenance for a shipped deck, so it
# is archived at NAS data/MARTS-DB/2026-07-31/dplm_snapshot_copy/ rather than
# treated as disposable.
data-bin/MARTS-DB/*/

# macOS Finder metadata
.DS_Store
**/.DS_Store
